ot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"N6JOX-Paul-Dickey-Memorial-Flyer0003\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-medium-file=\"\/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/N6JOX-Paul-Dickey-Memorial-Flyer0003.jpg?fit=194%2C300\" data-large-file=\"\/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/N6JOX-Paul-Dickey-Memorial-Flyer0003.jpg?fit=600%2C927\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-345239\" src=\"\/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/N6JOX-Paul-Dickey-Memorial-Flyer0003.jpg?resize=600%2C927\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"927\" srcset=\"\/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/N6JOX-Paul-Dickey-Memorial-Flyer0003.jpg?resize=663%2C1024 663w, \/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/N6JOX-Paul-Dickey-Memorial-Flyer0003.jpg?resize=194%2C300 194w, \/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/N6JOX-Paul-Dickey-Memorial-Flyer0003.jpg?resize=768%2C1187 768w, \/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/N6JOX-Paul-Dickey-Memorial-Flyer0003.jpg?w=1100 1100w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/> <img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"345240\" data-permalink=\"http:\/\/ccra.us\/2017\/10\/15\/paul-dickey-n6jox-sk-september-10-2017\/n6jox-paul-dickey-memorial-flyer0004\/\" data-orig-file=\"\/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/N6JOX-Paul-Dickey-Memorial-Flyer0004.jpg?fit=1100%2C1700\" data-orig-size=\"1100,1700\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"N6JOX-Paul-Dickey-Memorial-Flyer0004\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-medium-file=\"\/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/N6JOX-Paul-Dickey-Memorial-Flyer0004.jpg?fit=194%2C300\" data-large-file=\"\/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/N6JOX-Paul-Dickey-Memorial-Flyer0004.jpg?fit=600%2C927\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-345240\" src=\"\/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/N6JOX-Paul-Dickey-Memorial-Flyer0004.jpg?resize=600%2C927\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"927\" srcset=\"\/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/N6JOX-Paul-Dickey-Memorial-Flyer0004.jpg?resize=663%2C1024 663w, \/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/N6JOX-Paul-Dickey-Memorial-Flyer0004.jpg?resize=194%2C300 194w, \/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/N6JOX-Paul-Dickey-Memorial-Flyer0004.jpg?resize=768%2C1187 768w, \/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/10\/N6JOX-Paul-Dickey-Memorial-Flyer0004.jpg?w=1100 1100w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Paul R. Dickey Obituary<br \/>\nMar. 3, 1933-Sept. 10, 2017<br \/>\nDanville<br \/>\nPaul R. Dickey, passed away on Sunday, Sept. 10, 2017, at age 84. Born in Berkeley, California, to Paul B. and Cytha Gadberry Dickey. Married to the former Judith Ann Carter, of Seattle for 48 years. Two sons, Robert and Randy, daughter-in-law, Lisa, grandsons, Ben and Matthew. Paul earned AB degree from UC Berkeley, MA and PhD degrees from Golden Gate University. 25 year career with the IRS culminating with the position of District Director, Nevada. Retired 1983. Teaching career, University of Phoenix, East Bay and San Francisco State University, for 15 years. Devoted husband, father and community volunteer. Founding scoutmaster Troop 234, Moraga, 1983-1993. Silver Beaver recipient, highest award a Boy Scout council presents a volunteer. Licensed HAM radio operator, dedicated Bible student and member, Community Presbyterian Church, Danville. Celebration of Life at Moraga Valley Presbyterian Church, 10 Moraga Valley Lane, Moraga, Monday, Oct. 16, 1 pm. Reception following.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>It is with sadness to report that Paul Dickey, N6JOX passed away on Sunday September 10, 2017. Paul was a long time member of the CCRA and had supported our <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"http:\/\/ccra.us\/2017\/10\/15\/paul-dickey-n6jox-sk-september-10-2017\/\">Continue Reading &rarr;<\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_jetpack_newsletter_access":"","_jetpack_dont_email_post_to_subs":false,"_jetpack_newsletter_tier_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paywalled_content":false,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paid_content":false,"footnotes":""},"categories":[2],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-2226","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-ccra-news"],"jetpack_featured_media_url":"","jetpack_sharing_enabled":true,"jetpack_shortlink":"https:\/\/wp.me\/p69ory-zU","_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/2226","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=2226"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/2226\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":345241,"href":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/2226\/revisions\/345241"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=2226"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=2226"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=222